Attribution
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This project is the unified Python runtime of the Cognitive Fabric. It is
seeded from and extends:

  * KuzuMemPy-MCP — a Python port of KuzuMem-MCP (the MCP graph memory bank),
    from which this repository's memory-bank core is derived.

  * KuzuMem-MCP
    https://github.com/Jakedismo/KuzuMem-MCP
    Copyright the KuzuMem-MCP authors
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0

The "Cognitive Fabric" layer built on top of the memory-bank core comprises
in-process (no network sidecar) tree-sitter symbolic (AST) ingestion, a
LanceDB-backed semantic (vector) search layer, and a "dream"/evolution engine
that distills episodic memory into the semantic graph.
